{
  "name": "history-week-based-to-fixed-calendar-months-transition",
  "description": "A change from week-based years ending on the last Saturday of September (weeks from Sunday; 2022, numbered by 'start', is the 53-week year 2022-09-25 to 2023-09-30) to calendar years, through a three-month transition 2023-10-01 to 2023-12-31 with one quarter of three calendar months. Numbered by 'start': 2022, 2023 (the transition), 2024. The transition has 14 weeks, the last of them Sunday 31 December alone; its weeks do not nest in its quarter (LEVEL_NOT_NESTED) and their parent is the year, while weeks of 2022 nest in periods. Illustrative.",
  "source": {
    "kind": "oracle",
    "citation": "Independent implementation of the spec in conformance/generators/fiscal_oracle.py, written with Python datetime and no fiscalclock code",
